Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.95,0:23:12.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn华康娃娃体W5-A\fs180\bord9\shad9\c&H89FFFE&\3c&H1D3A52&\4c&H35C4F8&\pos(466.571,660.143)}高原的日常
